---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { url, styles, rooms, sceneImage } from '../../data/site';
export function getStaticPaths(){return styles.map(style=>({params:{slug:style.slug},props:{style}}));}
const {style:s}=Astro.props;
const others=styles.filter(style=>style.id!==s.id);
---
<SiteLayout title={s.name} description={s.summary} active="interior-design">
<section class="wrap page-heading"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={url()}>Macau flagship</a><span>/</span><a href={url('interior-design/')}>Interior Design</a><span>/</span><span>{s.name}</span></div><p class="eyebrow">DESIGN DIRECTION / {s.character}</p><div class="page-heading-grid"><h1>{s.name}<span>.</span></h1><div><p>{s.summary}</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="#rooms">Explore the six rooms <span>↓</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<figure class="wrap style-hero"><button class="image-button" data-lightbox={sceneImage(s.id)} data-caption={`${s.name} · Main entrance`} aria-label="Enlarge main entrance"><img class="full-image" src={sceneImage(s.id)} alt={`${s.name} double-height main entrance concept`} width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" /><span>View full image ↗</span></button><figcaption class="image-caption"><span>THE MAIN ENTRANCE / AN ARRIVAL WITH PRESENCE</span><span>Concept visualisation</span></figcaption></figure>
<section class="cream"><div class="wrap section material-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DESIGN LANGUAGE</p><h2>{s.headline}</h2><p class="lead">{s.idea}</p><div class="palette" aria-label="Material palette">{s.swatches.map((c,i)=><div><span style={`background:${c}`}></span><small>{s.labels[i]}</small></div>)}</div></div><div class="material-details"><div><span>Materials</span><p>{s.materials}</p></div><div><span>Light</span><p>{s.light}</p></div><div><span>The guest feeling</span><p>{s.feeling}</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="rooms"><div class="chapter-line"><span>THE ROOM COLLECTION</span><span>SIX SPACES / ONE ARCHITECTURAL LANGUAGE</span></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Follow the feeling<br />through the clinic.</h2><p>From the first impression to the most personal part of the visit. Open each room to explore the full image.</p></div><div class="room-grid">{rooms.map((r,i)=><article class="room-card"><button class="image-button" data-lightbox={sceneImage(s.id,r.id)} data-caption={`${s.name} · ${r.name}`} aria-label={`Enlarge ${r.name}`}><img src={sceneImage(s.id,r.id)} alt={`${s.name} ${r.name.toLowerCase()} concept`} loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941" /><span>0{i+1} / View room ↗</span></button><h3>{r.name}</h3><p>{r.note}</p></article>)}</div><p class="fine" style="margin-top:35px">These visualisations explore atmosphere and equipment integration. They are not measured room layouts; final proportions, clearances and technical specifications require coordination with the floor plan.</p></section>
<section class="cream"><div class="wrap section board-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE ORIGINAL STUDY</p><h2>Public energy.<br />Private calm.</h2><p>The original concept board brings the lounge and private suite together, establishing the relationship between hospitality and care.</p></div><button class="image-button" data-lightbox={url(`assets/${s.id}.png`)} data-caption={`${s.name} · Original lounge and suite study`} aria-label="Enlarge original concept board"><img src={url(`assets/${s.id}.png`)} alt={`${s.name} original public lounge and private suite concept board`} loading="lazy" /><span>Open concept board ↗</span></button></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>A different<br />point of view.</h2><p>Explore the other directions, or return to the comparison to see the same room in all four styles.</p></div><div class="style-grid" style="--columns:3">{others.map(o=><a class="style-card" href={url(`interior-design/${o.slug}/`)}><div class="style-card-image"><img src={sceneImage(o.id,'main-entrance',true)} alt={`${o.name} entrance`} loading="lazy" width="600" height="338" /></div><div class="style-card-line"><span>{o.character}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>{o.name}</h3></a>)}</div><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href={url('interior-design/#compare')}>Compare all four directions <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
